{
  "_comment": "采购供应链演示场景规格 v6（极简口径）。7 对象类型 / 6 条关系，全部 oneToMany FK backing（外键属性存真实 cm_*.id 外键值，目标端带 id 主键属性，JOIN 语义与底层库一致），零多对多、零中间表。v5 删除 PaymentTerm（类型+contractPaymentTerm 关系+漏斗）与供应商标签（Tag 类型+supplierTag 关系+打标动作+14 条 ol_edge）；v6 进一步删除供应记录（SupplyRecord 类型 + supplierSupply/materialSupply 两条关系 + cm_supply_record 中间表 + 漏斗），ol_edge 空表——凡关系必有字段关联，图上只有业务真实存在的一对多。演示层属性（rating/onTimeRate 为漏斗 CASE 派生，reviewStatus/lastReviewAt 为流程回写，只允许幕⑤ sync/Supplier 一次）。",
  "dam": {
    "domain": "supplychain",
    "application": "procurement",
    "module": "demo"
  },
  "sharedProperties": [
    {
      "apiName": "lifecycleStatus",
      "displayName": "生命周期状态",
      "baseType": "string",
      "description": "主数据生命周期（draft/published/deprecated）"
    },
    {
      "apiName": "sourceSystem",
      "displayName": "来源系统",
      "baseType": "string",
      "description": "该对象由哪个业务系统治理"
    },
    {
      "apiName": "governedBy",
      "displayName": "治理方",
      "baseType": "string",
      "description": "主数据治理责任部门"
    }
  ],
  "interfaces": [
    {
      "apiName": "GovernedMaster",
      "displayName": "可治理主数据",
      "properties": [
        "lifecycleStatus",
        "sourceSystem",
        "governedBy"
      ],
      "status": "active"
    }
  ],
